      <activity id="6869002b-478d-5630-bbfe-7d85622b6a1d" activityNameId="31a7eb9e-e63c-5f07-81d7-5589e908c5b4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Array and export cables, 33kV/110kV, onshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Array and export cables, 33kV/110kV, onshore wind farm
UUID=61e6427e-72af-339d-9b49-0c230ec01a69
Array and export cable for onshore wind farm, consisting of 33kV array cable and 110kV export cable.
Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1km.
Data are based on Vestas 100MW onshore wind farm consisting of V163-4.5MW wind turbines (Martinez Aguado &amp; Garrett, 2025).

Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_61e6427e-72af-339d-9b49-0c230ec01a69.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
